{"repositoryId":1376467797,"availability":"available","full":"orieg/discipline","name":"discipline","description":"Universal CI/CD gatekeeper and AI coding agent diff sentinel","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-18T21:53:22Z","updated":"2026-10-17T16:16:05Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://orieg.github.io/discipline/","topics":["ai-agents","ai-coding-agents","argo-workflow-templates","ci","code-quality","developer-tools","forgejo-actions","gitea-actions","github-actions","gitlab-ci","pre-commit","quality-gate","rust","sarif","static-analysis","testing","tree-sitter"],"demo":"https://orieg.github.io/discipline/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T00:42:04.097Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T00:42:04.097Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T00:42:04.097Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.678Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T00:42:04.097Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( []( [](#license) [](Cargo.toml) []( []( []( []( [](.pre-commit-hooks.yaml)","Autonomous coding agents operating in iterate-until-green loops optimize for passing tests, not preserving invariants:","Discipline inspects the diff against the merge base using tree-sitter AST parsing and fail-closed verification rigors. It rejects erosion patterns before they reach review, and it guards its own trust boundary: a change cannot switch its run to advisory, disable the gate that judges its configuration, narrow the CI step that runs the gate without a recorded reason, or (with directives.requireapproval) excuse itself without a review by someone else. On a push to the default branch, the waivers reviewed on the merged pull request still count: merged-pr-body reads that pull request's body…"],"features":["Weakening assertions (asserteq!(a, b) &rarr; assert!(a == b) or assert!(true)).","Adding vacuous \"ghost tests\" that compile and run but assert nothing.","Marking failing or flaky tests #[ignore] / @pytest.mark.skip / it.skip.","Stealthily deleting tests, fixtures, or benchmarks that stand in the way of a green build.","Dropping // SAFETY: justifications from unsafe blocks."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orieg/discipline/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"45c4fb16f1c8ee3bbb9ce912d1b1d8aeb1db9d80f820b184d2aa41168842c476","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.816Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.816Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( []( [](#license) [](Cargo.toml) []( []( []( []( [](.pre-commit-hooks.yaml)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orieg/discipline/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"45c4fb16f1c8ee3bbb9ce912d1b1d8aeb1db9d80f820b184d2aa41168842c476","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orieg/discipline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.816Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T18:49:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orieg/discipline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.817Z","hash":"45c4fb16f1c8ee3bbb9ce912d1b1d8aeb1db9d80f820b184d2aa41168842c476","originalBytes":28789,"storedBytes":28789,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:51.678Z","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata","match":"workflow"},{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"coding agent"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","Templates & UI components"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://orieg.github.io/discipline/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-19T01:01:26.565Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-1